### Feature ProductType — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (status = inactive)
### JWT + RBAC (desde el ISS-13): requiere el token de un usuario con la concesión
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

# @name deleteProductTypePhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# @name deleteProductTypeLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types/{{id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
